    "text": "8th Circuit Court of Appeals decides Sophia Wilansky v. Morton County case\nThe U.S. Court of Appeals for the 8th Circuit decided the case of Sophia Wilansky v. Morton County, North Dakota, U.S. Court of Appeals Case No: 24-1911, on June 24.\nThe court's decision is available to the public and can be viewed online. The case involved Sophia Wilansky and Morton County, North Dakota.\nFurther details about the ruling or its implications were not provided in the announcement.\nFor those interested in reading the full decision or learning more about related federal court opinions from North Dakota, additional information can be found through official court resources.",
